    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あのね、&lt;Shing&gt;……
&lt;Shing&gt;は
ミソミソなのは……嫌い？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Shing&gt;? Do you... hate how much miso I put on things?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミソミソ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How much miso...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミソミソは嫌い？
・嫌いじゃないよ！
・ちょっと嫌かなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is miso too much?
・Not at all!
・I'm not really a miso person...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>全然嫌いじゃないよ！
ミソ田楽も、サバのミソ煮も
大好きさ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not at all! I love miso on tofu, and miso braised mackerel is yummy too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ジィちゃんの
アクティブタの角煮にも
隠し味にミソが入ってるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gramps' special Powerhog stew even has miso as the secret ingredient!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……よかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see. I'm glad!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それにオレって
よく『脳ミソが足りないって』
言われるから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though, people always said that I'm "one spoon on miso short of a hotpot"...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たくさんミソを食べた方が
よさそうだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I eat plenty of miso, I don't get it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あははっ、おミソが
足りなくてもいいんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haha! No amount of miso's gonna help you there!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;には
その分、優しいスピリアが
いっぱいつまってるもん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That just proves what a kind, pure Spiria you have!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15748</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミソミソは
ちょっと嫌かなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm not really a miso person...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう……なんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh... I see.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、オレは焼き鳥は断然
『ミソ』より『タレ』派だからね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, like when it comes to yakitori, I prefer soy sauce over miso!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>焼き鳥？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yakitori?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17500</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>素人め！
焼き鳥といえば『塩』の
一択だろーが!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're such an amateur! When you get yakitori, salt is the ONLY choice right?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら、『ワサビじょうゆ』って
選択もあるんじゃないかしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, but what about wasabi and soy sauce?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ボクは『マヨネーズ』を
つけていただくのがいいなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I like mayonnaise on mine...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マヨなんて邪道ですわ。
焼き鳥といえば……&lt;Kunzite&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Putting mayonnaise on it is sacrilege! Speaking of yakitori... &lt;Kunzite&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もちろん『ぼんじり』です。
リチア様</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, the best cut of choice is chicken's neck.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20380</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ!?　味付けじゃなく
種類にいくかぁ？　なら
『レバー』が一番に決まってるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh?! Now we're not just talkin' flavor, but cuts? Then it's gotta be liver!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>確かにレバーもいいけど
『砂肝』も忘れないでね♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Liver is good too, but don't forget about gizzards! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>う〜ん、でも
『鳥皮』だけはカンベンだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm, I'm good with everything BUT skin. Yuck...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うわぁ……焼き鳥にも
いろんな好みがあるんだねぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wow. Who knew everyone liked so many types of yakitori?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22356</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人のスピリアの数だけ、ね。
みんなの想いがたったひとつ
だったら、つまらないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's just like how different people have different Spiria. It'd be boring if there was only one kind, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミソミソだったり
シオシオだったりするから
面白いんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's fun BECAUSE we have miso fans and salt fans!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだよね……
ミソミソやシオシオで
いいんだよね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. It's better that way!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
